---
title: ":bread: Cranberry Spice Bread"
source: Recipe Box
servings: 16
prep time: 15 minutes
cook time: 60 minutes
total time: 1 hour 15 minutes
tags:
  - breads
  - quick-bread
  - cranberry
  - spice
  - recipe-box
  - vegetarian
---

Preheat oven to 350°F. Grease two #loaf pans{2}.

In a #large mixing bowl{}, whisk together @all-purpose flour{2.5%cups}, @sugar{1.5%cups}, @baking soda{2%tsp}, @ground cinnamon{2%tsp}, and @salt{1/2%tsp}.

Add @milk{1.5%cups}, melted @margarine{6%Tbsp}, and @whole cranberry sauce{15%oz%can}. Stir just until combined.

Divide batter evenly between the prepared loaf pans.

Bake at 350°F for ~{1%hour} until a toothpick inserted into the center comes out clean.
